## Fixes
- equiv_harness (3): CODE DEFECT. The on-demand native-twin build ignored CARGO_TARGET_DIR, so the binary landed in /mnt/build/cargo/release/, not native-twin/target/release/. Now passes --target-dir <twin_dir>/target.
- abi_diff_integration (5): PROVISIONING. cargo install cargo-public-api --version 0.51.0 --locked (= discipline.yml CARGO_PUBLIC_API_VERSION).
- two_host_reconcile_2c (2): PROVISIONING. The Python Ed25519 backend goes in a venv, because PEP 668 blocks 'pip install --user' on this host: python3 -m venv ~/.venvs/maos-test && ~/.venvs/maos-test/bin/pip install cryptography (50.0.1), run with that venv first on PATH. CI installs it with 'pip install --user cryptography' (discipline.yml:3989).

